Package: dialogforgetransport
Type: Package
Title: Scoped Console Input and Bounded Runtime Transport for DialogForge
Version: 0.0.4
Authors@R: person("Adrian", "Dusa", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    email = "dusa.adrian@unibuc.ro")
Description: Scoped frontend console reads used by native R and WebR with one
    shared runtime prompt owner. Includes bounded binary socket input and
    checked frame writing with monotonic whole-frame deadlines.
    Socket lifecycle, protocol validation, prompt policy
    and output delivery remain caller owned.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
NeedsCompilation: yes
